### Signup New Hotel & Owner
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelName": "Grand Palace Hotel",
  "ownerName": "Nagaraju",
  "email": "nagaraju@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "city": "Hyderabad",
  "state": "Telangana",
  "country": "India",
  "postalCode": "500001"
}

### Signup Request with Missing Required Fields (Validation Failure Test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelName": "",
  "ownerName": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}